{
  "id": "lo04CrmSync00000",
  "name": "LeadOps 04 · CRM sync (Zoho Bigin)",
  "nodes": [
    {
      "parameters": {
        "content": "## CRM sync: Zoho Bigin (sub-workflow)\nInput: `inquiry_id`. Access tokens are refreshed from the refresh token and cached in Postgres (Zoho limits refreshes per 10 minutes). Header format is `Zoho-oauthtoken`, not Bearer.\n\nKnown contact → note only. Otherwise search by email / mobile → create if missing → add an inquiry note with source, campaign, language and answers.\n\nEnv: ZOHO_ACCOUNTS_URL, ZOHO_CLIENT_ID, ZOHO_CLIENT_SECRET, ZOHO_REFRESH_TOKEN, BIGIN_API_BASE",
        "height": 330,
        "width": 400,
        "color": 7
      },
      "id": "02d87fd7-33c6-5201-aa26-416d5e59a9b7",
      "name": "Note 1",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [
        -440,
        -80
      ]
    },
